```js
// Seule la fenêtre de réglages peut modifier l'état : l'overlay décode des médias non fiables.
const fromSettings = (e) => !!settingsWin && !settingsWin.isDestroyed() && e.sender.id === settingsWin.webContents.id;
const SETTINGS_KEYS = new Set(['serverUrl','volume','musicVolume','opacity','duration','videoDuration','soundOnArrival','spotlightOnDrop','autostart','overlayDisplayId','paused','theme','quietHours','avoidZone']);
```
- settings:set `(e, raw)`: `if (!fromSettings(e) || !raw || typeof raw !== 'object') return false; const patch = Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(raw).filter(([k, v]) => SETTINGS_KEYS.has(k) && v !== undefined));` The rest of the body stays as is.
- `if (!fromSettings(e)) return false;` at the top of connection:reconnect, connection:unlink-guild, connection:unblock-user, mute:set, history:clear, history:replay, update:check/download/install, test-drop and open-external.
- open-external: `try { const u = new URL(String(url)); if (u.protocol === 'https:') shell.openExternal(u.href); } catch {}`.
- drop:react: `(_e, arg) => { const { dropId, emoji } = arg || {}; …`.
- Read-only handlers stay open to both windows (overlay.js:916 calls getSettings).

```js
// Réglages masqués depuis 5 min : on détruit la fenêtre pour libérer son
// renderer ; createSettingsWindow() la recrée à la demande.
const SETTINGS_RELEASE_MS = 5 * 60_000;
let settingsReleaseTimer = null;
```
- createSettingsWindow, reuse branch: `clearTimeout(settingsReleaseTimer); settingsReleaseTimer = null;` before show()/focus().
- After creating: `const win = settingsWin; win.on('closed', () => { if (settingsWin === win) settingsWin = null; });`
- In the existing 'close' handler, after `settingsWin.hide();`: `clearTimeout(settingsReleaseTimer); settingsReleaseTimer = setTimeout(() => { settingsReleaseTimer = null; if (!win.isDestroyed() && !win.isVisible()) win.destroy(); }, SETTINGS_RELEASE_MS);`
- Leave the two appendSwitch lines alone.
destroy() runs long after the 150 ms debounce has flushed, so settings.js is unchanged. Only visible effect: after 5+ min hidden, the window reopens with a cold load at its default position.

